/T (2. OPINIONATED EDITORIAL  An op-ed is a niche piece written by a subject expert, who can have an elite opinion on the matter relating to that topic. In an op-ed, the reporter reflects on their individual perspectives and takes on the committee proceedings, and presents them wrapped in diplomacy. Taking subtle digs is fine, as long as brutality is kept at bay as far as possible. )
/E (2. OPINIONATED EDITORIAL  An op-ed is a niche piece written by a subject expert, who can have an elite opinion on the matter relating to that topic. In an op-ed, the reporter reflects on their individual perspectives and takes on the committee proceedings, and presents them wrapped in diplomacy. Taking subtle digs is fine, as long as brutality is kept at bay as far as possible. )
/Pg 11 0 R
